The media in this fixture (models/, media/, figures/, data/, charts/,
widgets/, words/) is generated by e2e/fixtures/gen-media.py or written for
the fixture, with no third-party assets, and is dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0. Regenerate the model, clip and clip poster with:

  python3 e2e/fixtures/gen-media.py

Draw the chart and bridge posters in figures/ with the fixture's own
tools/chart_poster.py (needs Pillow). Write the Plotly figures in charts/
with tools/plotly_figures.py.

runtimes/wave@1/ adapts the author's own waving-robot page from the website
(website-dev's hello-world post: the built widgets/wave/index.html, copied,
with the bridge and theme tokens added; the website copy is unchanged).

Everything else (main.tex, refs.bib, reader.css, tools/,
runtimes/wave@1/) is under the project licence.
